msgid ""
"Atlas 200I Pro needs the device nodes and host files below. Make sure the "
"container user can access the mapped devices."
msgstr "Atlas 200I Pro 需要下面这些设备节点和主机文件。请确保容器用户能够访问映射的设备。"

msgid ""
"On an openEuler host, use the `-310p-openeuler` image, mount `-v "
"/usr/lib64/libsemanage.so.2:/usr/lib64/libsemanage.so.2`, and replace the "
"`libyaml` source with `-v "
"/usr/lib64/libyaml-0.so.2.0.9:/usr/lib64/libyaml-0.so.2`."
msgstr ""
"在 openEuler 主机上，请使用 `-310p-openeuler` 镜像，挂载 `-v "
"/usr/lib64/libsemanage.so.2:/usr/lib64/libsemanage.so.2`，并将 `libyaml` 的源替换为 "
"`-v /usr/lib64/libyaml-0.so.2.0.9:/usr/lib64/libyaml-0.so.2`。"

msgid ""
"Every `--device` line needs its node to exist on the host: `docker run` "
"fails with `no such file or directory` when a device is missing, so drop "
"that line rather than keeping a node the machine does not have. The same "
"applies to the driver and host-file mounts listed above."
msgstr ""
"每一行 `--device` 都要求其节点在主机上存在：当某个设备缺失时，`docker run` 会以 `no such file or "
"directory` 报错退出，因此应删除该行，而不是保留一个机器上并不存在的节点。上面列出的驱动和主机文件挂载也是如此。"
